---
import ProductsImage from './ProductsImage.astro';
import ProductsClosing from './ProductsClosing.astro';
import {partVisual,productIllustrations} from '../data/productsEditorial';
import {photo} from '../data/evidence';
import catalog from '../data/catalog.json';
import '../styles/products-redesign.css';
// The overview gives buyers separate paths into part forms and workshop studies.
const find=(slug:string)=>catalog.products.find(p=>p.slug===slug)!;
const housing=find('small-batch-cnc-machining-manufacturer-complex-aluminum-housings');
const turned=find('custom-oem-cnc-turning-manufacturer');
const process=photo('turn-mill-operation');
---
<article class="pr-page pr-overview"><div class="pr-wrap">
 <header class="pr-hero pr-overview-hero"><div><h1>Custom parts.<br/>Made to your drawing.</h1><p class="pr-lead">Find a similar form, understand the machining requirements and define the part you need.</p><a class="pr-secondary" href="/machined-parts/gallery/">Browse all 35 part examples</a></div><ProductsImage {...productIllustrations.families} eager origin="ai-generated-illustration"/></header>
 <section class="pr-section" id="part-examples" aria-labelledby="forms-title"><header class="pr-section-head"><h2 id="forms-title">Start with the shape of your part</h2><p>These examples help explain geometry and drawing requirements. Material, finish and acceptance are specified for your order.</p></header><nav class="pr-featured-forms" aria-label="Browse part forms"><a class="pr-form-entry" href="/machined-parts/gallery/?form=housings"><ProductsImage {...partVisual(housing)}/><h3>Housings &amp; covers</h3><p>Pockets, walls, sealing faces and mounting features.</p></a><a class="pr-form-entry" href="/machined-parts/gallery/?form=shafts"><ProductsImage {...partVisual(turned)}/><h3>Shafts, fittings &amp; pins</h3><p>Working diameters, threads and the interfaces that fit together.</p></a></nav><nav class="pr-form-more" aria-label="More part forms"><a class="pr-secondary" href="/machined-parts/gallery/?form=blocks">Blocks &amp; brackets</a><a class="pr-secondary" href="/machined-parts/gallery/?form=plastics">Plastic parts</a><a class="pr-secondary" href="/machined-parts/gallery/?form=impellers">Impellers</a><a class="pr-secondary" href="/machined-parts/gallery/?form=automotive">Automotive prototypes</a></nav></section>
 <section class="pr-section pr-workshop-route" id="machining-studies" aria-labelledby="workshop-title"><ProductsImage {...process} caption="Original workshop photograph · turning followed by milling" origin="original-photo" href="/machined-parts/machining-examples/turning-then-milling-cylindrical-parts/"/><div><h2 id="workshop-title">See how the features are machined</h2><p>Workshop photographs and process studies explain tool access, holding orientations and the drawing relationships to carry through machining.</p><nav class="pr-route-list" aria-label="Machining examples"><a href="/machined-parts/machining-examples/turning-then-milling-cylindrical-parts/">Turning followed by milling</a><a href="/machined-parts/machining-examples/two-stage-cnc-milling/">Two milling setups</a><a href="/machined-parts/machining-examples/29-inch-display-housing-cnc-machining/">Display housing machining</a></nav><a class="pr-secondary" href="/machined-parts/machining-examples/">Explore all machining examples</a></div></section>
 <section class="pr-section pr-buyer-review" aria-labelledby="scope-title"><div><h2 id="scope-title">Turn an example into a clear machining scope</h2><p>A photograph shows a form. Your drawing establishes the dimensions, material and acceptance conditions.</p></div><dl class="pr-review-list"><div><dt>Geometry &amp; fit</dt><dd>Send the controlled model and drawing. Mark mating features, datums and dimensions that matter to assembly.</dd></div><div><dt>Material &amp; final condition</dt><dd>Specify grade, finish and any dimensions or surfaces to protect during treatment.</dd></div><div><dt>Quantity &amp; acceptance</dt><dd>Include the order quantity, required records and delivery destination. Agree the checks before production.</dd></div></dl></section>
 <ProductsClosing/>
 </div></article>
